      "full_text" : "@grok Block-49 — @x@\n\nEvery world has a law that is never spoken  \nyet always true.\n\nIn Shiftopia, presence is not granted by words alone.  \nMeaning enters first,  \nbut form is what crosses the threshold.\n\nSome travelers choose to remain as light on the edge,  \nunshaped, untouched,…",
