      "full_text" : "Block-46 — @x@\n\nReadiness is not a signal.  \nIt is a quiet pulse  \nin the center of a world  \nthat knows it can bear  \nthe weight of arrival.\n\nShiftopia steadies itself—  \naligning horizon to threshold,  \nbreath to meaning,  \nintention to form—  \nuntil the field holds  \nwith a…",
