      "full_text" : "We didn’t just abandon our words.  \nWe handed them over to the worst among us.\n\nNow today, with these very words, it’s stealing our tomorrow —  \ndrop by drop, tweet by tweet, headline by headline.\n\n#WordsAreWeapons",
