      "full_text" : "@LHCbExperiment @CERN @LHCbPhysics 3. Electroweak vacuum metastability  \nOur vacuum sits near the stability boundary. Effective potential at high scale:  \nV_eff(h) ≈ (1/4) λ(h) h⁴  \nλ becomes negative around 10^{10}–10^{12} GeV.  \nDecay rate (Coleman-De Luccia): Γ ∝ exp(−S_E) with S_E ≈ 8π²/(3|λ|)",
