      "full_text" : "@LHCbExperiment @CERN @LHCbPhysics 1. Higgs-like condensate before the Bang  \nWe assume the Higgs field φ was in a highly compressed state. Effective potential (RG-improved):  \nV(φ) ≈ −(μ²/2)φ² + (λ/4)φ⁴ + (ξ/2)R φ²  \n(ξ = non-minimal coupling to curvature R)",
      "lang" : "en",
